`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/quick-capture/components/NewPageHotKeyGate.tsx`\n\nRecord hooks:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-metadata/hooks/useObjectMetadataItem.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-metadata/errors/ObjectMetadataNotFoundError.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/hooks/useFindManyRecords.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/hooks/useCreateOneRecord.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/quick-capture/hooks/useCreateNewPage.ts`\n\nApp source (`a2eLink`):\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-links/src/objects/a2e-link.object.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-links/src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts`\n</task_result>\n</task>",
